{"parentUuid":"8e792e41-28fe-4ba0-8e30-dce379ab9eaa","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01LEvaM1ijaMihJwMziD7j4N","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2001d843-ba39-43d4-a010-c924bc8829eb","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:08:18.624Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"2001d843-ba39-43d4-a010-c924bc8829eb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgysiBts36sTDKp4dtFMp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The learning loop for notes about Bastion works and is pushed as cf2d3c7. CI passes with 335 tests, and the safeguard passed.\n\n- **The Guide now opens on \"Learned on journeys\".** Each note signed \"About Bastion\" shows its text, who signed it, and which journey it came from.\n- **One press: \"Make it guidance on <trail>\".** It creates a told rule with the note's words, on only at the trail that journey took, or at every trail if the journey had none on record. The note then reads \"Guidance now\", and the rule shows under Guidance like any other.\n- **Rules made this way can be removed** in the app, like other rules you made there.\n- **Live test:** I signed a test note on test journey `j1c15ab9b` and pressed \"Make it guidance on pull-request\". The server stored `learned-j1c15ab9b-…` as a told rule with scope `['pull-request']`. I then removed that rule. The test note itself stays in the audit chain, by design.\n\n**Next on this thread, in order:**\n1. **\"Make it a check\"** as well, at the waypoint the note came from. Notes record their journey but not the waypoint yet.\n2. **Write lessons and facts onto the journey's own branch** while it's still open, instead of a separate branch.\n3. **A lesson as a hook or permission** in `.agents/settings.json`.\n4. **Prove in a live run that a fact reaches an agent.** This costs one model run, so I'll wait for your go-ahead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":324,"cache_read_input_tokens":812494,"output_tokens":483,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":324,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":483,"cache_read_input_tokens":812494,"cache_creation_input_tokens":324,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":324},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fe2aa18f-d58e-468c-b930-e5c36541c7f6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgysiBUoZv8nnPV2J2Bup","type":"assistant","uuid":"a04fb6e3-a3eb-4b8a-b171-0aa54752aae5","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:08:18.621Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
