{"parentUuid":"9c64921c-dde4-4997-b132-0c0034e5d116","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Xrs4ausxWpRmmmdY8uduqz","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"06365876-38e9-437d-be14-4d8b9935968f","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:12:27.013Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"06365876-38e9-437d-be14-4d8b9935968f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgyt2oVWN8Dm7M6TN4Z8x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A lesson can now be a hook or a permission. Pushed as d0de751; CI passes with 336 tests, and the safeguard passed.\n\n- **In the app:** under **A lesson**, a second row offers **As a rule · As a hook · Allow · Ask · Deny**.\n  - **As a rule** writes `.agents/rules/<name>.md`, as before.\n  - **As a hook** asks for the command to run before each shell call.\n  - **Allow / Ask / Deny** asks for a rule such as `Bash(git push:*)`.\n- **On the server:** a hook or permission is merged into `.agents/settings.json`, read from the region's base branch. Everything the file already holds is kept, and the same entry isn't added twice. If the file doesn't exist, it's created. The change is committed on a branch of its own.\n- **Live test:** I signed a deny lesson, `Bash(git push --force:*)`, on test journey `j1c15ab9b`. demo-gh had no settings file, so a new one was created on its branch with that deny rule. `main` was unchanged, and I then deleted the branch. Signing a lesson with no command or rule is refused, and there's a test for that.\n\n**\"Make it a check\"** needed no new code. Once a note about Bastion becomes guidance on the Guide, the **Check** switch on its row promotes it and opens the Form for a word check, hook or reviewer.\n\n**Next on this thread:**\n1. **Write lessons and facts onto the journey's own branch** while it's still open.\n2. **Prove in a live run that a fact reaches an agent.** This costs one model run, so I'll wait for your go-ahead.\n3. **Return to the exploration plan:** route wear on the Map, and a legend on each chart."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":301,"cache_read_input_tokens":834650,"output_tokens":571,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":301,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":834650,"cache_creation_input_tokens":301,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":301},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"70266e13-de5d-4c98-9cf1-674ae25f693c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgyt2o2UrGVYmHiBKunSf","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca0216c7-10e8-4ff2-82cb-fa71e48e6d77","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:12:27.010Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
