{"parentUuid":"fc2baf1b-8967-48a8-9317-6a1125d69177","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgytdZjzZX8USDZQa5vye","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Map now shows each trail's wear and has a legend. Pushed as 8cd3893; CI passes with 337 tests, and the safeguard passed.\n\n- **Wear on each trail:** under each trail's name, for example \"2 journeys · 1 at the summit · 1 in the marsh\", or \"no journeys yet\".\n- **Wear at each waypoint:** an amber seal counts the journeys waiting there, and a red cross with a number marks those that ended there. On \"Steps to a PR\", the failed journey shows as a red cross with \"1\" at plan.\n- **Legend** along the bottom of the Map, in small italic: a region · an agent's waypoint · a script · rules on here · journeys waiting · ended in the marsh.\n- **Small fix:** the Map's lede no longer says \"atlas\".\n- **One limit:** of the 77 journeys on local, 59 are older than the field that records a journey's trail. They count toward no trail, which is why most trails show \"no journeys yet\".\n\n**Waiting on you:**\n- **Writing lessons and facts onto the journey's own branch.** A journey's branch also lives as a clone in its VM, so a commit Bastion makes on the host would diverge from what the agent pushes. Two options:\n  - write the note's change when the journey lands, onto the branch it lands;\n  - keep a separate branch, as now.\n\n  Which do you want?\n- **Proving a fact reaches an agent in a live run.** This costs one model run on a test region, so I need your go-ahead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":302,"cache_read_input_tokens":874450,"output_tokens":491,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":302,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":491,"cache_read_input_tokens":874450,"cache_creation_input_tokens":302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":302},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a72e8343-2c8f-4bc4-a976-efc5795c2824","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgytdZDjvGwXmaGHtEDuh","type":"assistant","uuid":"50b515d4-a9df-4c25-bd2c-5819df42d48d","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:20:17.988Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
