{"parentUuid":"fc2512da-c94d-4b8e-8bc2-869235807d87","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgyu6bLV2cXsmQsv1Mh4V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Notes now land with their journey. Pushed as 49f383c; CI passes with 338 tests, and the safeguard passed.\n\n- **Signed while the journey is under way or waiting:** the note is queued, and its card reads \"a lesson, written when the journey lands\".\n- **When the journey lands:** after its commits come back from the VM, and before it merges or is left for its pull request, Bastion writes every queued lesson and fact onto the journey's own branch. It commits them as \"What journey `<id>` taught: lessons and facts\".\n  - A fact's paths are inferred from the journey's final change at that point.\n  - Hook and permission lessons are folded into the journey's own `.agents/settings.json`.\n  - A failure here is logged and doesn't block the landing.\n- **Signed after the journey is home** (summit or marsh): it goes on a branch of its own, as before.\n- **Code:** what a note becomes now lives in one module, `crates/bastion-server/src/lessons.rs`, shared by the API and the landing. The audit record keeps the lesson's shape and detail, so the landing can rebuild it.\n- **Tests:** a new factory test checks that a queued lesson is written, added and committed on the journey's branch, and that a note about Bastion isn't. D61 and the plan are updated.\n- **Live check:** a test lesson signed on the waiting journey `jfbc0b38c` came back as \"on landing\", with no repository branch made.\n  - **This needs your attention:** if you approve `jfbc0b38c` and it lands, that test lesson will be committed onto its branch as `.agents/rules/test-lesson-print-helpers-return-none.md`. Delete that file before merging, or stop the journey.\n\n**Not proven live:** the landing itself. Proving it means letting a journey land, which costs model runs.\n\n**One limit with pull-request trails:** if a trail opens its pull request in a shell step before the journey lands, the lessons are committed to the local branch after that push. They won't be in the pull request until the branch is pushed again."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":455,"cache_read_input_tokens":898557,"output_tokens":665,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":455,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":898557,"cache_creation_input_tokens":455,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":455},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ff604f0f-e7fc-4ecd-a995-f3e163c91006","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgyu6awfqa2JsfrqRZaNP","type":"assistant","uuid":"12836a6e-d5e5-4ba7-9f8b-31badcad9d15","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:26:28.651Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
