{"parentUuid":"7c0da59d-4f08-4d31-aa4d-903a0a881564","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgyua1K8w2sBAwqmvA8Qn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"On the Map, a harbor town's card now shows what the region's charter holds, read from its base branch. I committed it locally as 47f81c1, plus c44c83f, which marks the item done in `PLAN.md`. Neither commit is pushed.\n\n- **On the card:** \"Its rules\" shows each `.agents/rules/*.md`. \"Its corpus\" shows each `.agents/corpus/*.md`, with the paths it is given on. The notes signed on journeys follow under their own headings.\n- **Server change:** `api/charters.rs` `texts` now also returns the Markdown files in `.agents/rules` and `.agents/corpus`. A side effect is that the Regions page can edit these files too.\n- **Checks:** CI passes with 340 tests, two of them new for these changes. The safeguard passed.\n- **Not checked in the app:** I didn't build and open the desktop, so I haven't seen the card render.\n\n**The pull-request gap needs a decision from you.** A trail's `gh pr create` shell step pushes from the VM before the journey lands, so the lessons written at landing don't reach the pull request. I see two ways to fix it:\n1. Write the queued lessons onto the branch before the trail's first shell step runs.\n2. Push the branch again from the host after landing. This needs the remote's credentials on the host.\n\nI recommend option 1.\n\n**Waiting on you:** the push, the choice above, and a go-ahead for the live corpus run, which costs one model run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":405,"cache_read_input_tokens":131548,"output_tokens":533,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":51},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":405,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":533,"cache_read_input_tokens":131548,"cache_creation_input_tokens":405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":405},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b84a4fa3-ddfd-4ed2-979a-8779fe3eea2c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgyua11XoYWwrG9r1dsrg","type":"assistant","uuid":"fc7a96f0-ff5a-438e-895b-a80f7ebdf8f9","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:32:37.778Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
