{"parentUuid":"3900fdd1-3d23-45b9-b0b7-9e94b7b5a206","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5f223b8f-973e-407d-9b08-2e890c5884bd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012zHqymFzg61K2vkSHe4oqK","type":"tool_result","content":"2:90:| D61 | What a journey teaches about its region is a charter change, never a separate atlas, so each repository stays the one source of truth for its project. It is one of two kinds: a lesson (codified practice: a rule in `.agents/rules/<name>.md`, or a hook or a permission in `.agents/settings.json`) or a fact (a corpus entry: the why: why the code is shaped this way, a surprise, a scenario for the product, in `.agents/corpus/<name>.md`, whose `paths:` globs say where it is relevant, inferred from the journey's change and the note). An agent is given a corpus entry only when it opens a matching path. Bastion writes charter changes only under `.agents/`. A note signed while the journey is under way is written onto the journey's own branch when it lands, with paths inferred from its final change; a note signed after the journey came home goes on a branch of its own. What a journey teaches about Bastion itself stays in Bastion's database and feeds the learning loop on the Guide. This replaces D59's atlas. |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"61811be2-66f3-49ae-99a8-bf80624a9441","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:35:59.495Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"2:90:| D61 | What a journey teaches about its region is a charter change, never a separate atlas, so each repository stays the one source of truth for its project. It is one of two kinds: a lesson (codified practice: a rule in `.agents/rules/<name>.md`, or a hook or a permission in `.agents/settings.json`) or a fact (a corpus entry: the why: why the code is shaped this way, a surprise, a scenario for the product, in `.agents/corpus/<name>.md`, whose `paths:` globs say where it is relevant, inferred from the journey's change and the note). An agent is given a corpus entry only when it opens a matching path. Bastion writes charter changes only under `.agents/`. A note signed while the journey is under way is written onto the journey's own branch when it lands, with paths inferred from its final change; a note signed after the journey came home goes on a branch of its own. What a journey teaches about Bastion itself stays in Bastion's database and feeds the learning loop on the Guide. This replaces D59's atlas. |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"29798715-ecdb-4f4b-8bb8-cceac8286d6a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3900fdd1-3d23-45b9-b0b7-9e94b7b5a206","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
