_words.clone(), v)))","         .size(13);","     let ready = !d.function.trim().is_empty();","     let add = crate::lift::button(text(\"Add the check\").size(13))","         .style(theme::primary)","-        .on_press_maybe(ready.then(|| Message::Rules(Msg::AddCheck(c))));","+        .on_press_maybe(ready.then_some(Message::Rules(Msg::AddCheck(server.into()))));","     let cancel = crate::lift::button(text(\"Cancel\").size(13))","         .style(theme::link)","-        .on_press(Message::Rules(Msg::Draft(e, None)));","+        .on_press(Message::Rules(Msg::Draft(server.into(), None)));","     column![call, words, row![add, cancel].spacing(6)]","         .spacing(6)","         .into()"]},{"oldStart":335,"oldLines":3,"newStart":330,"newLines":52,"lines":["         .spacing(12);","     scrolled(body)"," }","+","+#[cfg(test)]","+mod tests {","+    use super::*;","+","+    #[test]","+    fn a_note_becomes_guidance_or_a_check_at_its_waypoint() {","+        let note = FieldNoteView {","+            job: \"j1\".into(),","+            at: 7,","+            text: \"Never push from a plan step.\".into(),","+            workflow: \"bug-fix\".into(),","+            step: \"plan\".into(),","+            ..FieldNoteView::default()","+        };","+        let told = guidance(&note);","+        assert_eq!(","+            (told.rung.as_str(), told.steps.clone()),","+            (\"told\", vec![\"bug-fix/plan\".to_string()])","+        );","+        assert_eq!(waypoint_words(&note), \"bug-fix › plan\");","+        let d = Draft {","+            note: note.clone(),","+            function: \" sandbox::exec \".into(),","+            contains: \"git push\".into(),","+        };","+        let c = check(&d);","+        assert_eq!(c.id, \"learned-check-j1-7\");","+        assert_eq!(","+            (c.function.as_str(), c.contains.as_str(), c.rung.as_str()),","+            (\"sandbox::exec\", \"git push\", \"enforced\")","+        );","+        assert_eq!(c.steps, [\"bug-fix/plan\"]);","+        let old = FieldNoteView {","+            step: String::new(),","+            ..note.clone()","+        };","+        assert_eq!(","+            waypoint(&old),","+            \"bug-fix\",","+            \"a note from before waypoints: its trail\"","+        );","+        let none = FieldNoteView {","+            workflow: String::new(),","+            ..note","+        };","+        assert_eq!(waypoint_words(&none), \"every trail\");","+    }","+}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/harness.rs"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9f9717d6-4b58-4d92-bf56-5c1f69c06ee9","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":5,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"81794fb4-f2c8-4237-bb7d-0c29b59467ff","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
