{"parentUuid":"42bd2b21-74ae-4007-a3ed-52ac57a174c4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgywKjwkyM2sf71FuiVok","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"L3 is done. The Journeys page now has a decisions inbox, committed as 838d4cb and not pushed. CI passes with 344 tests, and the safeguard passed.\n\n- **Held calls:** a journey under way with calls the gate holds for a person now appears under \"Waiting for you\". Its line says \"· 2 calls held for you\". The tile, the tab badge and the window title count these journeys too. Before this, such a journey showed only as \"under way\".\n- **Charter changes to merge:** a new section lists each region's charter branches that aren't merged into its base branch, with the subject, server, region, branch and age. It follows the server switcher and the region filter. A new route, `GET /charters/branches`, provides the list.\n- **No merge button:** each branch says to review and merge it in the region's repository. Merging from the app would change your base branch, so I left it out.\n\n**Live check:** I made a test charter branch on demo-local, and it appeared as \"Charter changes to merge (1)\". I then deleted the branch. The server switcher shows \"two\" again.\n\n**Not checked live:** I didn't produce a held call, because that needs a model run. A unit test covers the held count and the wording.\n\nNext in the plan: L6 moves the factory lines to each region (they are still global, against D58). L7 is plugins, and L8 is the first-run checklist."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":278819,"output_tokens":431,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"infere