{"parentUuid":"8acb71d9-5a21-48f5-a853-237b393d3033","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01X6Gry25mYtogKFW4abv8Gc","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bfc4d623-4f7e-499e-a3db-4fd51eb73b04","timestamp":"2026-11-13T00:01:12.082Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"bfc4d623-4f7e-499e-a3db-4fd51eb73b04","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgywkVpQ7L3gFBXSJeEWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"L6 is done. The factory lines now come from each region's settings and each trail's steps, so no server-wide list remains. Committed as f409020 and not pushed. CI passes with 345 tests, and the safeguard passed.\n\n- **Each region gets two lines:**\n  - **Land a finished journey:** \"Merges a finished journey's branch into main\", or for demo-gh \"Leaves a finished journey on its branch, ian/<id>, for its pull request\".\n  - **Send failing work back:** \"2 times a step by default, at most 3 times a journey\", followed by any step that sets its own limit.\n- **One line covers the network:** it names the steps whose trails mark them for it, such as \"Full › ci\".\n- **On the Guide:** each line's chip names its region, or reads \"Each step\" for the network line. I checked this live in the app.\n- **Where to change them:** you still change these on Regions or on the trail. The Guide only shows them.\n\n**One part of the plan item isn't built:** a step can't override how a journey lands, because only the end of the journey lands. I left that out.\n\nNext is L7 (plugins from a git URL at a pinned commit) or L8 (the first-run checklist). L8 is smaller."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":265,"cache_read_input_tokens":305735,"output_tokens":390,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":265,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":390,"cache_read_input_tokens":305735,"cache_creation_input_tokens":265,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":265},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a738f473-327e-4a77-9eaa-c32432bca808","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgywkVVoGW6hvCoaw77US","type":"assistant","uuid":"042b955a-bf35-41fc-9862-6ae7f110c36a","timestamp":"2026-11-13T00:01:12.080Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
