{"parentUuid":"7b4dfd66-f8aa-479b-9b85-7f087fc9dbf5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyxQ4espvbT3o16qYuek","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"L8 is done. Committed as 8c03782 and not pushed. CI passes with 346 tests, and the safeguard passed after one fix.\n\n- **The checklist:** Journeys shows \"First steps on <server>\" for each server shown that is missing a ready model, a region, or a first journey. A done step gets ✓. An open step gets ○ and a button to Settings, Regions or New journey. The card goes away once all three are done.\n- **Unreachable servers:** a server that can't be read adds no card.\n- **Live check:** server \"two\" has no ready provider, and its card showed the model step open with the other two done. Local is fully set up and showed no card.\n- **Safeguard fix:** it first flagged a complex conditional in `first_steps`. I rewrote it to check whether any step is still open, and it passed.\n\n**Not handled:** the button opens Settings without switching to that server first. In \"All servers\" view that's fine, because Settings lists every server.\n\n**Not pushed:** 47f81c1 and c44c83f went out earlier. 84fb158, 838d4cb, f409020 and 8c03782 are still local.\n\n**Left in the plan:** L7, plugins from a git URL at a pinned commit. It's the largest item, and it has open questions about plugin hooks that expect the host machine and about stdio MCP servers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":326556,"output_tokens":429,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":422,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":326556,"cac