{"parentUuid":"ec8b4047-e06e-4da6-871b-60be7ce67247","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch1PZCJAthvR6CXfmPz1Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The push hasn't reached origin yet. origin/main is still at aa794b0, and the background push (de4bbae and four earlier commits) is still running. The next plugin step is built and staged but not committed, because I couldn't run the CodeScene safeguard.\n\n**The next plugin step:**\n- A skill or agent step can name a plugin's part as `<plugin>:<name>`, such as `caveman:caveman`. Result names still have to be one word.\n- When a journey is provisioned, its VM gets each plugin its steps name, at the pinned commit, under `/work/plugins/<name>`. Bastion moves it as a git bundle.\n- The step is told to read `/work/plugins/<plugin>/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md` or `/work/plugins/<plugin>/agents/<agent>.md`.\n- The journey keeps \"The plugins this journey runs with: caveman@<sha>\" as an artifact. I used an artifact because storing it on the journey's runtime would need a database migration.\n- On the Guide, a skill or agent part shows \"at <trail> › <step>\" where a step names it, and \"off\" otherwise.\n- CI passes with 352 tests, three of them new.\n- **Not checked live:** I didn't run a journey through this, which would cost a model run.\n\n**What's blocking the commit:** the CodeScene MCP server disconnected (\"Request timed out\"). I then tried to call its safeguard tool directly over stdio with `npx @codescene/codehealth-mcp`. The auto-mode classifier denied that because it runs code fetched from outside. Your rule is to commit only after the safeguard passes, so the files are staged and nothing is committed.\n\nTo go on, either:\n1. Reconnect CodeScene with `/mcp`, and I'll run the safeguard and commit, or\n2. Allow the `npx @codescene/codehealth-mcp` command, or\n3. Tell me to commit without the safeguard this once."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":266,"cache_read_input_tokens":411813,"output_tokens":695,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":266,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":695,"cache_read_input_tokens":411813,"cache_creation_input_tokens":266,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":266},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"946869e4-7698-4f14-b7ab-f62d2e3b39b0","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch1PZC23UjwuWpami2XpA","type":"assistant","uuid":"8a6f9bd5-9d61-4123-9663-294b0e2d2d6b","timestamp":"2026-11-13T18:20:13.778Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
